<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reizo — Reservas directas para hostales, tours y restaurantes en Ecuador</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Webs bilingües que hacen que los turistas te encuentren en Google y reserven directo por WhatsApp, sin comisiones de Booking. Ecuador.">
    <style>
        /* ========================
           ISU ARCHITECTURE v2
           Black. White. One Accent Color.
           ======================== */

        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0a0a0a;
            --bg-darker: #000000;
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #888888;
            --accent: #00ffcc;
            --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-darker);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Custom cursor: SOLO en dispositivos con mouse */
        @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
            body { cursor: none; }
            .cursor {
                position: fixed;
                width: 24px; height: 24px;
                border: 2px solid var(--accent);
                border-radius: 50%;
                pointer-events: none;
                z-index: 9999;
                mix-blend-mode: screen;
                transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
            }
            .cursor.active { transform: scale(1.5); background: rgba(0,255,204,0.2); }
        }
        @media (hover: none), (pointer: coarse) {
            .cursor { display: none; }
        }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
            html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
        }

        /* ========================
           HEADER
           ======================== */
        header {
            position: fixed; top: 0; width: 100%;
            background: rgba(10,10,10,0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }
        nav {
            max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 48px;
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: letter-spacing 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1), color 0.3s;
        }
        .logo:hover { letter-spacing: 12px; color: var(--accent); }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 40px; list-style: none; }
        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.3s; position: relative;
        }
        .nav-links a::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -8px; left: 0;
            width: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--accent);
            transition: width 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
        .nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

        .nav-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
        .lang-toggle {
            background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-secondary); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 2px;
            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; cursor: pointer;
            text-transform: uppercase; transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .lang-toggle:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

        .nav-button {
            background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg-darker);
            padding: 12px 28px; border: none; border-radius: 2px;
            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
        }
        .nav-button:hover {
            background: var(--text-primary); transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,255,204,0.3);
        }

        /* ========================
           HERO
           ======================== */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 80px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 48px;
        }
        .hero::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(0,255,204,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .hero-content { max-width: 1100px; width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: left; }
        .hero .eyebrow {
            display: inline-block; color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,255,204,0.3); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            animation: slideInUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1) both;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 68px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 28px; text-transform: uppercase;
            animation: slideInUp 1s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1) both;
        }
        .hero h1 .highlight { color: var(--accent); }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 19px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 44px;
            line-height: 1.8; max-width: 640px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            animation: slideInUp 1s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1) both; animation-delay: 0.1s;
        }
        .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; animation: slideInUp 1s both; animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        @keyframes slideInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg-darker);
            padding: 18px 40px; border: none; border-radius: 2px;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
            text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--text-primary); transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,255,204,0.3); }
        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent; color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 18px 40px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 2px;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
        }
        .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

        /* ========================
           SECCIONES GENERALES
           ======================== */
        section { padding: 110px 48px; }
        .section-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .section-header { margin-bottom: 64px; }
        .section-label {
            color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .section-title { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1px; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .section-subtitle { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 17px; max-width: 640px; font-weight: 300; }

        /* ========================
           ROI / EL CÁLCULO
           ======================== */
        .roi { background: var(--bg-dark); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        .roi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; margin-top: 24px; }
        .roi-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 2px; padding: 44px 36px;
            background: var(--bg-darker); transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }
        .roi-card:hover { border-color: rgba(0,255,204,0.35); }
        .roi-card .roi-tag { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 700; }
        .roi-card .roi-number { font-size: 52px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .roi-card.bad .roi-number { color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
        .roi-card.good .roi-number { color: var(--accent); }
        .roi-card p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; }
        .roi-footnote { margin-top: 36px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 300; max-width: 720px; }
        .roi-footnote strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700; }

        /* ========================
           SERVICIOS
           ======================== */
        .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 32px; }
        .service-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 2px; padding: 44px 36px;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1); background: var(--bg-dark);
        }
        .service-card:hover { border-color: rgba(0,255,204,0.35); transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .service-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        .service-description { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; }

        /* ========================
           PAQUETES
           ======================== */
        .pricing { background: var(--bg-dark); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        .pricing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 28px; align-items: stretch; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .price-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 2px; padding: 44px 32px;
            background: var(--bg-darker); display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            transition: all 0.3s; position: relative;
        }
        .price-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .price-card.featured { border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(0,255,204,0.08); }
        .price-badge {
            position: absolute; top: -14px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg-darker);
            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 7px 18px; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .price-name { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .price-amount { font-size: 54px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -2px; line-height: 1; }
        .price-amount span { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-secondary); letter-spacing: 0; }
        .price-maint { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 12px 0 28px; font-weight: 300; }
        .price-maint strong { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
        .price-features { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 36px; flex-grow: 1; }
        .price-features li {
            padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 300; padding-left: 24px; position: relative;
        }
        .price-features li::before { content: '—'; color: var(--accent); position: absolute; left: 0; }
        .price-card .btn-primary, .price-card .btn-secondary { width: 100%; text-align: center; }

        /* ========================
           GARANTÍA
           ======================== */
        .guarantee-band {
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,255,204,0.35); border-radius: 2px;
            padding: 56px 48px; text-align: center; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(0,255,204,0.07) 0%, transparent 60%);
        }
        .guarantee-band .g-label { color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .guarantee-band h3 { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.35; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .guarantee-band h3 .highlight { color: var(--accent); }
        .guarantee-band p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; }

        /* ========================
           DEMO / PROYECTOS
           ======================== */
        .portfolio-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .project-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;
            background: var(--bg-dark); transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column;
        }
        .project-card:hover { border-color: rgba(0,255,204,0.35); transform: translateY(-4px); }
        .project-image {
            height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 56px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,255,204,0.06), transparent);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }
        .project-content { padding: 36px 32px; flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .project-category { color: var(--accent); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .project-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .project-description { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-grow: 1; }
        .project-cta { margin-top: auto; }

        .demo-types { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 22px; }
        .demo-type {
            background: var(--bg-darker); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 2px;
            color: var(--text-secondary); padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: inherit;
        }
        .demo-type:hover { border-color: rgba(0,255,204,0.35); color: var(--text-primary); }
        .demo-type.active { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); background: rgba(0,255,204,0.06); }

        /* ========================
           PROCESO
           ======================== */
        .process-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 28px; }
        .process-step { border-top: 2px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 28px; transition: border-color 0.3s; }
        .process-step:hover { border-top-color: var(--accent); }
        .process-num { color: var(--accent); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .process-step h4 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        .process-step p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7; }

        /* ========================
           FAQ
           ======================== */
        .faq { background: var(--bg-dark); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        .faq-list { max-width: 800px; }
        .faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        .faq-item summary {
            padding: 26px 0; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
            list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }
        .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
        .faq-item summary::after { content: '+'; color: var(--accent); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 300; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .faq-item[open] summary::after { content: '—'; }
        .faq-item summary:hover { color: var(--accent); }
        .faq-item .faq-answer { padding: 0 0 28px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 680px; }

        /* ========================
           CONTACTO
           ======================== */
        .contact-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
        .contact-info h2 { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1px; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .contact-info > p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 48px; max-width: 460px; }
        .contact-methods { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; }
        .contact-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .contact-value { color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 17px; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s; }
        a.contact-value:hover { color: var(--accent); }

        .contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; }
        .form-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .form-input, .form-textarea {
            width: 100%; background: var(--bg-dark); border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 2px; padding: 15px 16px; color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 15px; font-family: inherit; transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }
        .form-input:focus, .form-textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); }
        .form-textarea { min-height: 120px; resize: vertical; }
        .submit-btn {
            background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg-darker); border: none; border-radius: 2px;
            padding: 18px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .submit-btn:hover { background: var(--text-primary); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,255,204,0.3); }
        .form-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 300; text-align: center; }

        /* Focus visible para accesibilidad */
        a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px;
        }

        footer {
            background: var(--bg-darker); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 40px 48px; text-align: center;
        }
        footer p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); letter-spacing: 1px; }

        /* ========================
           RESPONSIVE
           ======================== */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 52px; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .roi-grid, .services-grid, .portfolio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; }
            .process-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .contact-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 56px; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            header { padding: 14px 0; }
            nav { padding: 0 20px; }
            .hero { margin-top: 70px; padding: 24px 20px; }
            .hero h1 { font-size: 38px; }
            .section-title { font-size: 34px; }
            section { padding: 70px 20px; }
            .guarantee-band { padding: 44px 24px; }
            .guarantee-band h3 { font-size: 23px; }
            .process-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .contact-info h2 { font-size: 32px; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 31px; }
            .hero-cta { flex-direction: column; }
            .btn-primary, .btn-secondary { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
            .price-amount { font-size: 44px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <nav>
            <a href="#" class="logo">Reizo</a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#roi" data-i18n="nav_roi">El Cálculo</a></li>
                <li><a href="#paquetes" data-i18n="nav_pricing">Paquetes</a></li>
                <li><a href="#proyectos" data-i18n="nav_work">Demo</a></li>
                <li><a href="#faq" data-i18n="nav_faq">Preguntas</a></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="nav-right">
                <button class="lang-toggle" id="langToggle" aria-label="Switch language">EN</button>
                <button class="nav-button" onclick="document.getElementById('contacto').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})" data-i18n="nav_cta">Contactar</button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="hero_eyebrow">Hostales · Tours · Restaurantes · Ecuador</span>
            <h1 data-i18n-html="hero_title">Más reservas <span class="highlight">directas.</span><br>Cero comisiones.</h1>
            <p data-i18n="hero_sub">Webs bilingües (español + inglés) que hacen que el turista te encuentre en Google y te reserve directo por WhatsApp — sin pagarle 15-18% a Booking por cada huésped.</p>
            <div class="hero-cta">
                <a href="#contacto" class="btn-primary" data-i18n="hero_cta1">Diagnóstico gratis · 15 min</a>
                <a href="#paquetes" class="btn-secondary" data-i18n="hero_cta2">Ver paquetes</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ROI -->
    <section class="roi" id="roi">
        <div class="section-container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <div class="section-label" data-i18n="roi_label">El Cálculo</div>
                <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="roi_title">Haz la cuenta</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle" data-i18n="roi_sub">Un hostal con 20 reservas al mes por intermediarios pierde esto en comisiones:</p>
            </div>
            <div class="roi-grid">
                <div class="roi-card bad">
                    <div class="roi-tag" data-i18n="roi_bad_tag">Con intermediarios (15-18% por reserva)</div>
                    <div class="roi-number">$720 – $1.080</div>
                    <p data-i18n="roi_bad_text">Al año, solo en comisiones. Dinero que sale de tu negocio cada mes, para siempre.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="roi-card good">
                    <div class="roi-tag" data-i18n="roi_good_tag">Con reservas directas por tu web</div>
                    <div class="roi-number">$0</div>
                    <p data-i18n="roi_good_text">La reserva llega directo a tu WhatsApp. El 100% se queda contigo.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="roi-footnote" data-i18n-html="roi_footnote">El sistema completo cuesta <strong>desde $549, una sola vez</strong>. Se paga solo con <strong>3-4 reservas directas al mes</strong>. Todo lo demás es ganancia tuya, mes tras mes.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Servicios -->
    <section class="services" id="servicios">
